WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.840
My team and I turn attention into dollars. We are a marketing and AI implementation agency.

00:05.840 --> 00:10.720
I live stream on the internet one hour a day. It's called Funnel Hacking Live.

00:10.720 --> 00:16.320
Funnel hacking is where I go online like a customer and walk your entire customer journey.

00:16.320 --> 00:21.920
I find you online. I really like what you have to say. I'd love to buy something from you.

00:21.920 --> 00:29.360
75% of the time, I can't. You send me to your Facebook page. Nobody answers. Nobody books me in.

00:29.600 --> 00:35.840
Here's the thing. The marketing that works is 100 years old. It still works. Two things changed.

00:35.840 --> 00:42.400
Attention used to cost TV and radio ad money. Now, it's free on a dozen social media channels.

00:43.600 --> 00:50.880
Now, AI employees. They answer every lead in seconds, day or night, and book your appointments.

00:50.880 --> 00:55.600
Put those two together and you get a marketing machine that never existed before.

00:55.600 --> 01:01.760
Real estate team, clinic, coach, service business. If people are paying attention and you have

01:01.760 --> 01:07.600
something to sell, that machine is what we build for you. I wrote a book about our process. It's

01:07.600 --> 01:14.320
called Attention To Dollars. Attention, plus your offer, equals dollars. There are three ways to work

01:14.320 --> 01:21.440
with us. Do it yourself, done with you, or done for you. You're in the right place. Have a look

01:21.440 --> 01:23.440
around. I look forward to talking.

